<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You just came down from up\nthere...?\rSo! You musta solved the\nstone-panel puzzle!\rThat’s crazy!\rYou got some real talent for\narchaeology.\fHere, take this UNOWN Report.\rIt log UNOWN as you catch ’em.\nIt’ll come in clutch!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somethin’ weird in here...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This a big room, but there’s\nnothin’ in here. Not even a couch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This place got a mystical vibe.\r...Or a historic vibe...\f...Or a creepy vibe...\f...Or an ancient vibe...\f...Or a serious vibe...\f...Or a chilly vibe...\fBasically, it feel kinda spooky.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nobody robbed these ruins or\nmessed with ’em. No graffiti, neither.\rEverything still clean.\nSomethin’ in here make people\ffeel like they gotta respect it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a replica of an ancient homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm.\rI been studyin’ the ruins for\nyears, but somethin’ feel...\fdifferent.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh!\rThe UNOWN pictures on the wall...\rFeel like they starin’ at me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What is this?\nSomethin’ creepy makin’\fmy legs shake.\fI can’t stop ’em!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, you good?\nYou vanished right in front of me.\fI almost passed out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0076_D24R0205_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see.\rThe power of ARCEUS and UNOWN\nmixed up into a huge energy,\fand sent you to the Sinjoh Ruins...?\rUNOWN, the Ruins, and ARCEUS...\fThe mystery get deeper...\rNow I’m even MORE nosy!\rOne day I’ma crack every mystery!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
